    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7222b28cb19725567237",
      "document_start": 38,
      "document_end": 58,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 1;",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e250312eaba243466a13",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 69,
      "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4a3fdd70ccabdcce3547",
      "document_start": 70,
      "document_end": 102,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c7a9a69337385cdb9161",
      "document_start": 104,
      "document_end": 177,
      "text": "非线性弹性与弹塑性材料中的塑性阶段均呈现非线性物理性质，按加载过程考察，这两类问题的非线性性质相同，只要给出其非线性本构关系，其计算方法是一样的。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b7a3762f20a12795a845",
      "document_start": 177,
      "document_end": 210,
      "text": "其不同点表现在：一是弹塑性材料的转折点出现在从弹性进入塑性的阶段；",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2c6fd12aaeaa45b3607e",
      "document_start": 210,
      "document_end": 227,
      "text": "二是卸载过程会出现不同的物理现象。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8c92d23a44228f27aa72",
      "document_start": 227,
      "document_end": 257,
      "text": "非线性弹性问题是可逆的，卸载后结构应变会恢复到加载前的水平。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5f188d66981a046982da",
      "document_start": 257,
      "document_end": 312,
      "text": "而弹塑性材料却会出现不可逆应变，即弹性阶段是可逆的，塑性阶段是不可逆的，且其卸载时的载荷-应变曲线呈线性关系。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_26c037229614591d723b",
      "document_start": 312,
      "document_end": 338,
      "text": "再加载时会出现残余应变和大于初始弹性极限的弹性区域。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5c13f6e85838e3d64c2e",
      "document_start": 338,
      "document_end": 364,
      "text": "因此，导致应力-应变关系的不唯一，且与加载历史有关。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7b250c9e722c2e4aa508",
      "document_start": 366,
      "document_end": 386,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_35e3915509709a545c73",
      "document_start": 387,
      "document_end": 397,
      "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_34c65a2742d80be82c25",
      "document_start": 398,
      "document_end": 430,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6e66a397ffe60ed228c2",
      "document_start": 432,
      "document_end": 498,
      "text": "另外，某些材料在常应力条件下，其变形与时间有关，往往随着载荷作用时间的延长，其蠕变应变增大，这种蠕变的非线性主要由材料物理性态引起。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2f89cb2a68c92cc1996b",
      "document_start": 498,
      "document_end": 534,
      "text": "材料的应变随时间变化的特性称为黏性，可分为线性黏性材料和非线性黏性材料。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e53d6a162cd4de4d2e31",
      "document_start": 534,
      "document_end": 581,
      "text": "具有黏性的材料可以采用一些简单的力学模型，如黏性元件、弹性元件、塑性元件等，如图2-18所示。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4d5ad5da53183ce6ddbd",
      "document_start": 583,
      "document_end": 603,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4a45eddb57eb8e09b3ba",
      "document_start": 604,
      "document_end": 614,
      "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9c227a980c6be20f29bc",
      "document_start": 615,
      "document_end": 647,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_badba0164ac758f2643c",
      "document_start": 649,
      "document_end": 672,
      "text": "将弹性元件与黏性元件组合，可得黏弹性材料模型。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_86fa8b59fc41a9eb1012",
      "document_start": 672,
      "document_end": 696,
      "text": "将其并联，称为开尔文（Kelvin）黏弹性模型；",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_91cbc61bba732c28de21",
      "document_start": 696,
      "document_end": 723,
      "text": "将其串联，称为麦克斯韦尔（Maxwell）黏弹性模型。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_32e4412fe53b8274ff01",
      "document_start": 723,
      "document_end": 790,
      "text": "将弹性、塑性和黏性三类元件以不同的形式加以组合，可以获得更为复杂的材料模型，如广义开尔文模型、Burgers模型等，如图2-19所示。",
      "section_id": "section_9751476853a1"
    }
  ],
