          "document_start": 338,
          "document_end": 364,
          "text": "因此，导致应力-应变关系的不唯一，且与加载历史有关。",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 338,
          "end": 364,
          "chunk_start": 338,
          "chunk_end": 364,
          "sentence_document_start": 338,
          "sentence_document_end": 364,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_7b250c9e722c2e4aa508",
          "document_start": 366,
          "document_end": 386,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 366,
          "end": 386,
          "chunk_start": 366,
          "chunk_end": 386,
          "sentence_document_start": 366,
          "sentence_document_end": 386,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_35e3915509709a545c73",
          "document_start": 387,
          "document_end": 397,
          "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 387,
          "end": 397,
          "chunk_start": 387,
          "chunk_end": 397,
          "sentence_document_start": 387,
          "sentence_document_end": 397,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_34c65a2742d80be82c25",
          "document_start": 398,
          "document_end": 430,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 398,
          "end": 430,
          "chunk_start": 398,
          "chunk_end": 430,
          "sentence_document_start": 398,
          "sentence_document_end": 430,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6e66a397ffe60ed228c2",
          "document_start": 432,
          "document_end": 498,
          "text": "另外，某些材料在常应力条件下，其变形与时间有关，往往随着载荷作用时间的延长，其蠕变应变增大，这种蠕变的非线性主要由材料物理性态引起。",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 432,
          "end": 498,
          "chunk_start": 432,
          "chunk_end": 498,
          "sentence_document_start": 432,
          "sentence_document_end": 498,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2f89cb2a68c92cc1996b",
          "document_start": 498,
          "document_end": 534,
          "text": "材料的应变随时间变化的特性称为黏性，可分为线性黏性材料和非线性黏性材料。",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 498,
          "end": 534,
          "chunk_start": 498,
          "chunk_end": 534,
          "sentence_document_start": 498,
          "sentence_document_end": 534,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e53d6a162cd4de4d2e31",
          "document_start": 534,
          "document_end": 581,
          "text": "具有黏性的材料可以采用一些简单的力学模型，如黏性元件、弹性元件、塑性元件等，如图2-18所示。",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 534,
          "end": 581,
          "chunk_start": 534,
          "chunk_end": 581,
          "sentence_document_start": 534,
          "sentence_document_end": 581,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4d5ad5da53183ce6ddbd",
          "document_start": 583,
          "document_end": 603,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 583,
          "end": 603,
          "chunk_start": 583,
          "chunk_end": 603,
          "sentence_document_start": 583,
          "sentence_document_end": 603,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4a45eddb57eb8e09b3ba",
          "document_start": 604,
          "document_end": 614,
          "text": "# 1）材料非线性;",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 604,
          "end": 614,
          "chunk_start": 604,
          "chunk_end": 614,
          "sentence_document_start": 604,
          "sentence_document_end": 614,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9c227a980c6be20f29bc",
          "document_start": 615,
          "document_end": 647,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 615,
          "end": 647,
          "chunk_start": 615,
          "chunk_end": 647,
          "sentence_document_start": 615,
          "sentence_document_end": 647,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_badba0164ac758f2643c",
          "document_start": 649,
          "document_end": 672,
          "text": "将弹性元件与黏性元件组合，可得黏弹性材料模型。",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 649,
          "end": 672,
          "chunk_start": 649,
          "chunk_end": 672,
          "sentence_document_start": 649,
          "sentence_document_end": 672,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_86fa8b59fc41a9eb1012",
          "document_start": 672,
          "document_end": 696,
          "text": "将其并联，称为开尔文（Kelvin）黏弹性模型；",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 672,
          "end": 696,
          "chunk_start": 672,
          "chunk_end": 696,
          "sentence_document_start": 672,
          "sentence_document_end": 696,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_91cbc61bba732c28de21",
          "document_start": 696,
          "document_end": 723,
          "text": "将其串联，称为麦克斯韦尔（Maxwell）黏弹性模型。",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 696,
          "end": 723,
          "chunk_start": 696,
          "chunk_end": 723,
          "sentence_document_start": 696,
          "sentence_document_end": 723,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_32e4412fe53b8274ff01",
          "document_start": 723,
          "document_end": 790,
          "text": "将弹性、塑性和黏性三类元件以不同的形式加以组合，可以获得更为复杂的材料模型，如广义开尔文模型、Burgers模型等，如图2-19所示。",
          "section_id": "section_9751476853a1",
          "start": 723,
          "end": 790,
          "chunk_start": 723,
          "chunk_end": 790,
          "sentence_document_start": 723,
          "sentence_document_end": 790,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
